AdiButtonAuras Forever
======================

This repository is a modified version of **AdiButtonAuras 11.0.4**.

Original project: https://github.com/AdiAddons/AdiButtonAuras
Original license: GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE)
Original authors: the AdiAddons project contributors.

This is an unofficial port to WoW Forever (interface 16001, game version 1.60.1).
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original authors, Blizzard
Entertainment, or CurseForge.

Modifications, 2026-11-16, by felippeb:

- added `Forever.lua`, a compatibility layer loaded before the embedded libraries;
- rewrote the aura cache for restricted and secret reads: freeze the last good
  snapshot, merge while restricted, replace when the client is readable;
- added remembered own casts for auras the client hides in combat;
- added Forever-specific paladin rules (seals, blessings, auras, Righteous Fury);
- added seal family tracking and stale-seal suppression after a swap;
- self-buffs match by aura id or normalized name and include buffs from other players;
- added `/abaforever` diagnostics, SavedVariables probe output, and error capture;
- target-debuff rules (Judgement, Consecration) were intentionally removed: enemy
  auras are unreadable by addons in combat on this client, so any timer would be a
  guess. The buttons stay neutral instead.

The modified work is distributed under GPL-3.0. The corresponding source is this
repository.
